WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.710
- I always like to finish up the hour

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.330
with something fun from social media.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.983
Here's today's what I'm liking.

00:00:04.983 --> 00:00:08.190
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.240
When it comes to travel,

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.330
there are endless unique
experiences to be had,

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.370
but have you heard, because I hadn't

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.490
of lodging in a six ton potato?

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.780
It's a real thing, people,

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.420
you can do in where
else, but Boise, Idaho.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.320
It's amazing.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.570
We have the creator of this potato hotel

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.780
on the line watching on
Boise, Idaho News 6 at 4.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:28.896
Let's say hi to Kristie.

00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:31.117
Oh my god.

00:00:31.117 --> 00:00:31.950
- Hi Kelly.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.320
- Oh my god, I love you so much.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.670
This is so cool and different.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.470
How did you come up with this?

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.440
- This potato actually
was a promotional prop

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.510
by the Idaho Potato Commission.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:45.750
So it has traveled many, many miles

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.210
on the back of a semi
truck going to festivals

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.130
and fairs all over the country.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:53.160
And I was a spokesperson
for two years with it.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.130
When they finally decided
that they needed to upgrade

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.950
to a more like roadworthy fiberglass one

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:02.460
they actually gifted me this
and I turned it into an Airbnb.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.350
- Oh my God, look at the inside of that.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:07.410
What? You should have
a design show, ma'am.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.280
That was so cute.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:12.540
So, what types of people rent
out a giant potato to stay in?

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.630
- Well, this is was I
think my fourth Airbnb

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.830
and I didn't know if it
would actually be as popular

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:22.740
but luckily people like
to stay in the potato

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.930
as many people like to eat potatoes.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.970
So we have road trippers.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:28.320
The gal that stayed last night

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:32.310
had a potato themed
manicure set for the stay.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:34.740
We've had weddings and we've even have,

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.350
I know at least one baby
that was conceived here

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.305
and they nicknamed him Tater Tot.

00:01:40.305 --> 00:01:42.510
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.190
See I actually wanna have that,

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:45.960
I just wanna meet the people
that stay in this potato.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.398
I just think that would be a fun hang

00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:49.740
'cause it's hilarious and it's awesome.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.560
And honestly, you have really
great interior design skills.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:53.610
That was really, really cute.

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:55.530
Thank you so much, Kristie.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:56.790
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:57.653
- [Kristie] Thank you.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.333
- All right.

00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:00.166
And that's not all, ma'am.

00:02:00.166 --> 00:02:01.440
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.270
makers of Friction, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:04.410
of The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:07.680
want to celebrate those creating
fearlessly just like you.

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.573
So they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:11.416 --> 00:02:13.980
- Are you freaking kidding?

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:16.260
- Oh my God, I love you so much, Kristie,

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.243
you have made me so happy today.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:19.973
Thank you so much

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.070
to all our guests this hour,
Sarah Hyland, Natasha Leggero,

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:26.910
Courtney Rich, Alicia Brown,
Erica, Donna, Gary Brode,

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.570
Morgan Fogarty and all our
friends at WCCB Charlotte CW.

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:31.403
Y'all have a great day,

00:02:31.403 --> 00:02:33.183
